ContentStateTest
├── setActiveObserver
│   ├── given an observer and handlers
│   │   └── it uses them on the next flush
│   └── given the observer is cleared
│       └── it stops flushing
└── flushObserverRecords
    ├── given no observer is active
    │   └── it does nothing
    ├── given the queue is empty
    │   └── it replays nothing
    ├── given only our own writes are queued
    │   └── it discards them
    ├── given a page mutation is queued alongside ours
    │   ├── it replays the page mutation
    │   └── it does not replay ours
    └── given an observer with no handlers
        └── it drains without replaying
